<title>UK: DMG/CCF lead 1.5 billion FRF Nov 2002 FRN for RIBS.</title>
<headline>DMG/CCF lead 1.5 billion FRF Nov 2002 FRN for RIBS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers Credit Commercial de France and Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RIBS</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  SECURED ON EUROPEAN SOVEREIGN BONDS</p>
<p> AMT    1.5 BLN FRF   BASE	 3M-PIBOR  MATURITY    07.NOV.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +8 BP     PAY DATE    20.JUN.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   ISS PRICE  100.0625  FULL FEES   0.15</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (M) 1	   GOV LAW     ENGLISH</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
